[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6965.109, "timestamp": "01:56:05", "text": "那么，当写作时，比如在某个地方写作时，该如何处理呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6968.709, "timestamp": "01:56:08", "text": "你得注意措辞，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6971.75, "timestamp": "01:56:11", "text": "东西。是的，因为有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6973.669, "timestamp": "01:56:13", "text": "写作过程中有很多事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6975.589, "timestamp": "01:56:15", "text": "在那里，你的声音可能会听起来像某人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6976.96, "timestamp": "01:56:16", "text": "退化，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6978.31, "timestamp": "01:56:18", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6982.31, "timestamp": "01:56:22", "text": "但你不需要，你必须具体一些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6985.629, "timestamp": "01:56:25", "text": "用你的语言。就像，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6988.109, "timestamp": "01:56:28", "text": "哦，她得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6990.47, "timestamp": "01:56:30", "text": "非组成性地与"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6991.87, "timestamp": "01:56:31", "text": "男性或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6993.99, "timestamp": "01:56:33", "text": "与其只说 R，不如说点别的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6999.83, "timestamp": "01:56:39", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7001.589, "timestamp": "01:56:41", "text": "还有一些词语，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7003.669, "timestamp": "01:56:43", "text": "这会激怒像你这样的人，你不能随便说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7005.99, "timestamp": "01:56:45", "text": "大声说出来，因为就像某些人一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7009.109, "timestamp": "01:56:49", "text": "人们可能会因此受到刺激。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7010.95, "timestamp": "01:56:50", "text": "所以你得换个说法来表达……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7018.79, "timestamp": "01:56:58", "text": "我喜欢写作。写作就像……"}]